        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 7050GT, Clear Crystal Georgetown Knobset with Modern #4 Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Arch Georgetown Knobset is a great choice for transitional homes. This crystal door knob paired with the sandcast rosette will add a touch of romance to your home while remaining in the current design trends. The Clear Crystal Georgetown Knobset with Modern #4 Rose is available in a dummy function, a passage function for halls and closets, and a privacy function for bedrooms and bathrooms. The rosette is available in 3 finishes, which highlight the texture of the piece, making it look like something straight from out of the old world.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Half-Round Georgetown Knob with #4 Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Georgetown Knobset with Sandcast Bronze Arched Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Steam: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Arch Georgetown Knobset",
                "description": "The Modern Arch Georgetown Knobset is a great choice for transitional homes. This crystal door knob paired with the sandcast rosette will add a touch of romance to your home while remaining in the current design trends. The Clear Crystal Georgetown Knobset with Modern #4 Rose is available in a dummy function, a passage function for halls and closets, and a privacy function for bedrooms and bathrooms. The rosette is available in a black steel finish and a satin steel finish, which highlight the texture of the piece, making it look like something straight from out of the old world.",
                "keywords": "Clear Crystal Georgetown Knobset with #4 Roses, Modern Arch Georgetown Knobsets, Emtek 7050GT, Emtek 7100GT, Emtek 7200GT, Georgetown Knobset with Sandcast Bronze Arched Rosettes, Half-Round Georgetown Knob with #4 Arched Roses, Clear Crystal Georgetown Knobset with Modern #4 Roses,"
